# Shard 'b' is a one-line driver: it execs the sibling battery, which sources the sibling
# advisor-gate-deny/lib.sh (and its seed.sh). Both sibling directories are read whole.
core/fixtures/advisor-gate-deny-mutants/
core/fixtures/advisor-gate-deny/
# The hook under test and its provenance sibling: seed.sh locates the hook at <root>/core/hooks/
# and every mutant is a sed rewrite of a copy of it beside a copy of the provenance library.
!core/hooks/ai-dlc-advisor-gate.sh
!core/hooks/ai-dlc-context-provenance.sh
# The sibling battery verifies that every other shard driver exists and drives its shard.
core/fixtures/advisor-gate-deny-mutants-c/
core/fixtures/advisor-gate-deny-mutants-d/
core/fixtures/advisor-gate-deny-mutants-e/
